  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: add Claude Code skill for AI-assisted SDK generation 2026-03-10\n- feat: migrate initialize command from .sln to .slnx format 2026-03-09\n- feat: use default/const values from OpenAPI parameters as C# default parameter values 2026-03-05\n- feat: improve oneOf/anyOf ergonomics with semantic variant naming (#133) 2026-03-05\n- feat: More broad support for .http files 2026-03-04\n- feat: Added support for ServerSentEvents. 2026-03-04\n- feat: Enhance ToTypeString method to handle combined types in OpenAPI 3.1 2026-01-21\n- feat: Update target framework to net10.0 across multiple project files 2026-01-21\n- feat: Update OpenAPI handling with YAML reader support and improve type handling in schema extensions 2026-01-21\n- feat: Update CLI commands and project file for improved OpenAPI handling and disable deprecated commands 2026-01-21\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: don't emit required keyword for const properties with defaults 2026-03-10\n- fix: filter out JsonObject defaults to prevent invalid C# syntax 2026-03-10\n- fix: suppress duplicate CLI action warnings when --generate-cli is not set 2026-03-09\n- fix: handle all-caps words in property name conversion 2026-03-05\n- fix: add System.Net.ServerSentEvents package for non-.NET 10 frameworks 2026-03-04\n- fix: quote Content-Disposition name/fileName in generated multipart/form-data code (#132) 2026-03-04\n- fix: Fixed Vectara types 2026-03-04\n- fix: prevent infinite loop on circular schema references (#118) 2026-03-03\n- fix: register concrete List<T> types in JsonSerializerContextTypes (#106) 2026-03-03\n- fix: generate ByteArrayContent for application/octet-stream request bodies 2026-03-03",
